<qti-assessment-item xmlns="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.imsglobal.org/xsd/imsqtiasi_v3p0 https://purl.imsglobal.org/spec/qti/v3p0/schema/xsd/imsqti_asiv3p0_v1p0.xsd" identifier="pcb-item-a82603f9086441bf8e741e38963f10fa" title="Quick Check: Measurement (usage)" adaptive="true" time-dependent="false">
  <qti-response-declaration identifier="RESPONSE" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-correct-response><qti-value>D</qti-value></qti-correct-response>
  </qti-response-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="SCORE" cardinality="single" base-type="float">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>0</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="FEEDBACK" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier"/>
  <qti-outcome-declaration identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" cardinality="single" base-type="identifier">
    <qti-default-value><qti-value>show_interaction</qti-value></qti-default-value>
  </qti-outcome-declaration>
  <qti-item-body>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="show_interaction" outcome-identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY" show-hide="show" class="qti-margin-0">
      <qti-content-body>
        <p>Which sentence uses the word <strong>Measurement</strong> correctly?</p>
    <qti-choice-interaction response-identifier="RESPONSE" shuffle="true" max-choices="1">
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="A">Congress passed a strict measurement to cut air pollution.</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="B">The pianist practiced the first measurement of the piece until it was perfect.</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="C">In a measurement of goodwill, the airline refunded every passenger.</qti-simple-choice>
      <qti-simple-choice identifier="D">The tailor took careful measurements of Theo's shoulders before cutting the fabric.</qti-simple-choice>
    </qti-choice-interaction>
      </qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>

    <qti-feedback-block identifier="CORRECT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>Correct! This sentence uses measurement correctly because a measurement is a size or amount established by measuring — the tailor measured Theo's shoulders to get exact figures before cutting.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
    <qti-feedback-block identifier="INCORRECT" outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" show-hide="show">
      <qti-content-body><p>The correct sentence is the one about the tailor measuring Theo's shoulders, because a measurement is a size or amount established by measuring. A law passed by Congress is a measure, a unit of music is also a measure, and a kind act is a gesture of goodwill — sound-alike traps, not measurements.</p></qti-content-body>
    </qti-feedback-block>
  </qti-item-body>
  <qti-response-processing>
    <qti-response-condition>
      <qti-response-if>
        <qti-match><qti-variable identifier="RESPONSE"/><qti-correct identifier="RESPONSE"/></qti-match>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">1</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">CORRECT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">completed</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="INTERACTION_VISIBILITY"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">hidden</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-if>
      <qti-response-else>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="SCORE"><qti-base-value base-type="float">0</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="FEEDBACK"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">INCORRECT</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value>
      
        <qti-set-outcome-value identifier="completionStatus"><qti-base-value base-type="identifier">incomplete</qti-base-value></qti-set-outcome-value></qti-response-else>
    </qti-response-condition>
  </qti-response-processing>
</qti-assessment-item>